Data licences for this folder and site/public/map.json
=====================================================

This is a licensing note, not a grant of anyone else's rights. The files here mix four sources and this
project's own work; each part keeps its own terms. This is a non-commercial project. No permission has been
asked of WHO or IHME (see docs/research/data-sources.md, "Licence decisions").

1. ICD-11 content (WHO): codes, titles and URIs in tree.json, crosswalk.json, burden.json and map.json.
   International Classification of Diseases, Eleventh Revision (ICD-11), World Health Organization (WHO) 2019
   https://icd.who.int/browse11. Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivatives 3.0 IGO licence
   (CC BY-ND 3.0 IGO). Release used: ICD-11 MMS 2026-01. Every entry keeps its ICD-11 code, title and URI.

2. GBD results (IHME): the DALY figures in burden.json and map.json, and GBD cause names and ids.
   Source: Institute for Health Metrics and Evaluation. Used with permission. All rights reserved.
   GBD 2023, global DALYs for 2023, used under the IHME Free-of-Charge Non-Commercial User Agreement
   (https://www.healthdata.org/data-tools-practices/data-practices/ihme-free-charge-non-commercial-user-agreement).
   They are not licensed for commercial use by anyone, and raw GBD files are not in this repository.

3. ChEMBL (EMBL-EBI): the cross_check fields in proposals/ and assessments/, chembl-release.json, and the
   crossCheck fields in map.json are derived from ChEMBL 37 approved-drug indications. ChEMBL is licensed under
   CC BY-SA 3.0 Unported; cite Mendez D et al., Nucleic Acids Res. 2019;47(D1):D930-D940,
   doi:10.1093/nar/gky1075. These files are shared alike under CC BY-SA 3.0.

4. ClinicalTrials.gov (U.S. National Library of Medicine): trial counts and phases in bars.json and map.json,
   derived from the ClinicalTrials.gov API v2, data processed on the date in bars.json ("dataTimestamp").
   This project counted running interventional trials per GBD cause and ranked them by phase; see
   docs/spec/v1.md, "Pipeline bar (stage 7)".

5. This project's own work, licensed CC BY-SA 3.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/) so that it
   can be combined with the ChEMBL-derived parts:
   - the ICD-11 -> GBD cause cross-walk (crosswalk.json, crosswalk-review.yaml, gbd-extra-codes.yaml). It is
     built from WHO's ICD-11 -> ICD-10 table and IHME's cause -> ICD-10 lists, and is not a WHO or IHME product;
   - MeSH search terms (mesh.yaml, MESH-SECOND-OPINION.md);
   - statuses, nuance notes and source lists (proposals/, assessments/, events.json). They were proposed by AI
     (Claude) from the cited sources and approved by the project owner, but have not been reviewed by a
     clinician. They are not medical advice;
   - pipeline bookkeeping (stamps.json).
   Attribution: "Disease Map, https://github.com/qa1roO/disease-front".
